Z||000005||ChopTop||11-07-2001||11:33 AM||||The rear window in my chop top is removable, but I'm considering sealing it up.  The air stream goes over the windshield and roof, and then is immediately sucked down the back window pulling motor heat and exhaust fumes directly into the interior from the deck lid vents.  It is also much noisier. Opening both windows and removing my sunroof does help alleviate those problems, but only when the car is in motion.  I really do like the feature, just not sure I want to keep it. it.     ||||reg||1
